sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Completer
  participant R as Router
  participant P as Primary
  participant F as Fallback
  C->>R: route(task, strategy)
  R-->>C: decision + chain
  C->>P: complete
  P-->>C: retryable error
  C->>F: complete next in chain
  F-->>C: success
  C-->>C: log attempts + cost
